  "job_B3.3.6_20251003_114724": {
    "text": "Gehera\u00f0 ge nu hw\u00e6t ic eow secgan wille ymbe \u00fea halgan rode \u00fee crist on \u00ferowode hu heo on \u00feeosne\n\u00dea\u00f0a w\u00e6s agan an hund wintra & \u00feri & \u00feritti wintra \u00e6fter cristes \u00ferowunge & upstige to heofenum \u00fea\nHe w\u00e6s eawf\u00e6st on \u00feeawum & arf\u00e6st on d\u00e6dum, cristenra manna fultumend & n\u00e6s \u00feeah \u00feagyt\n\u00dea on \u00feam sixtan g\u00e6re \u00fee Constantinus rixode \u00fea w\u00e6s gesamnod micel \u00e6l\u00feeodig folc to \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 hit sona \u00feam m\u00e6ran Constantine \u00feam kasere gecyd & he \u00fea sone gegaderode micele fyrde &\n\u00dea hio to \u00fe\u00e6re ea coman \u00fea geseah he \u00f0\u00e6r \u00fea mycelan & \u00fea ungerimedlican ferde \u00fe\u00e6ra his fionda.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s he swi\u00f0e sarig & geunrodsad o\u00f0 dea\u00f0 for\u00fean\u00fee he wende \u00fe\u00e6t hi ealle scoldon sweltan.\n\u00dea on \u00feare ylcan nihte \u00fee constantinus slep & hine gereste \u00fea com him to sum swi\u00f0e f\u00e6ger \u00e6ncgel on\n& he \u00f0a sona beseah up on \u00fe\u00e6re heofenan & \u00fe\u00e6r geseah \u00fe\u00e6t halw\u00e6nde tacen Christes rode on myceles\nHe awoc \u00fea bli\u00feelice for \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6geran gesih\u00f0e & for \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ran behatenan sige & mearcode him on\n\u00d0a sone on mergen het se kasere constantinus gewyrcan ane gyldene rode on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan gelicnesse \u00fee\nSona swa hio on \u00fe\u00e6t halige rode taken beseagon \u00fea wurdon hio sona afyrhte & to fleame gehwyrfde.\n& constantinus se m\u00e6re kasere \u00fea sige h\u00e6fde & his fyrd \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan ofsloh & hi eac sume on \u00fe\u00e6re ea\nOn \u00feisum d\u00e6ge se \u00e6lmihtiga god sealde mycelne sige \u00feam m\u00e6ran kininge constantine \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t mycele\n\u00c6fter \u00feam \u00fee se m\u00e6re kasere eft ham gew\u00e6nde to his agenre byrig into rome.\n\u00dea het he him to gelangian ealle \u00fea ealdorm\u00e6n & \u00fea boceras \u00fe\u00e6s iudeiscan folces & acsode hiom hw\u00e6s\nHio \u00fea cw\u00e6don, hit is \u00fe\u00e6t mycele & \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6re heofenlice tacen \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s lifigendan godes sunu on\n\u00d0a \u00fe\u00e6t geacsodon \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r cristene w\u00e6ron \u00fea coman hio hr\u00e6dlice to \u00f0am m\u00e6ran kasere constantine &\n& tealdon him \u00fea \u00ferowunga \u00fee ure h\u00e6lend on \u00fe\u00e6re rode \u00f0rowode for mankynnes h\u00e6lo & alesednesse\n\u00dea \u00feis \u00feam m\u00e6ran kasere constantine geteald w\u00e6s \u00fea wear\u00f0 he swi\u00f0e bli\u00f0e on mode & as\u00e6nde \u00fea his\n\u00dea sona se biscop \u00fe\u00e6s gode \u00feancode & hine gefullode on f\u00e6der naman & sunu & on \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes\n& he \u00fea ealle hiora diofolgeld tobr\u00e6c & towearp & him \u00fe\u00e6r cirican gehalgode & ealle ciriclice hades\n\u00d0a sio\u00f0\u00f0en se m\u00e6ra kasere constantinus w\u00e6s getrymed mid rihtan geleafan he \u00fea liornian ongan \u00fea\n\u00dea he geliorned h\u00e6fde on \u00feam halgan bocum on hwylcere stowe ure drihten on rode ahangen w\u00e6s \u00fea\n& he hire bebead \u00fe\u00e6t hio scolde on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan stowe cirican getimbrian \u00fe\u00e6r hio \u00feurh godes fultum \u00fea\nSeo eadige cwen elena \u00fea f\u00e6stlice hire hiht gesette on gode \u00e6lmihtigum & toferde.\n\u00dea hio ineode on \u00fea wuldorfullan byrig ierusalem \u00fea het hi hiore togesamnian eall \u00fe\u00e6t iudeisce folc.\n\u00dea \u00fea hi coman beforan hire \u00f0a spr\u00e6c hio hiom to & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic wat & geliornod h\u00e6bbe on eower\n& ge witan hu ure drihten godcunde wuldre geworhte fela blinda he onlihte & deafum hearcnunge\n& eowre eldran \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan drihten middaneardes alesend \u00feurh diofles lare to dea\u00f0e gedemdon &\n& he on \u00feam \u00f0riddan d\u00e6ge of dea\u00f0e aras.\n& get eowre heortan aheardode siondon \u00fe\u00e6t ge ne magon ongeton ne oncnawan \u00fe\u00e6ne so\u00fef\u00e6stan\nAc seo awyrgednes ofer eow wuna\u00f0 \u00fee eower yldran ab\u00e6don sylfe on \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00ferowunga ures drihtnes \u00fea\nAc geceosa\u00f0 eow nu \u00fea wisestan m\u00e6n of eowre m\u00e6g\u00f0e to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t hio me rihtlice andwyrdan magon\n& hio \u00fea mid myclum ege uteodon & giornlice \u00feohtan hw\u00e6t seo acsung beon scolde.\n& hio \u00fea gecuron \u00feusend \u00feara betst gel\u00e6redra iudeiscra manna & \u00fea toforan \u00feare halgan cwene\n\u00d0a spr\u00e6c seo halige cwen elena, undernima\u00f0 nu mine word.\nLa, hu ne liornodon ge on eowrum witegung bodum be \u00feam tocyme \u00fe\u00e6s anc\u00e6nnedan godes sunu, \u00fe\u00e6t\nSwa ge selfe ealle \u00fea \u00feinc witan & cunnan.\n& nu get ge ongytan nella\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s ic eow acsian wille.\nHi andswarodon hire & cw\u00e6don, sege us hl\u00e6fdige, for hwi \u00feu us \u00feus sti\u00felice word tosprece?\nHi andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, ga\u00f0 ut & geceosa\u00f0 eow of \u00feisum \u00fea weras \u00fee betst gel\u00e6rede bion \u00fe\u00e6t hio me\nHio \u00fea mid mycclum ege uteodon fram \u00fe\u00e6ra cwena & heom betwionan geflit h\u00e6fdon & geornlice\n\u00dea spr\u00e6c \u00fe\u00e6r an Iudas w\u00e6s gehaten, Ic wat so\u00felice hw\u00e6t \u00feeos axung bion wile, ymbe \u00feas halgan rode\nGif \u00feeos cwen \u00feises axian wille \u00feonne behealdan ge hw\u00e6\u00feer ge hit hire gecy\u00fean willen for \u00fean we\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea eft, Zacheus min ealde f\u00e6der s\u00e6de minum f\u00e6der & min f\u00e6der s\u00e6de me & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to me,\nFor\u00feam n\u00e6fre ma iudeisc folc l\u00e6nc ne rixa\u00f0, ac \u00feonne bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6ra manna rice \u00fee gelefa\u00f0 on \u00feone\n\u00dea andswarode ic minum f\u00e6der & cw\u00e6\u00f0, f\u00e6der min, gif ure yldran wysten \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s crist \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 min f\u00e6der to me, Iuda min bearn \u00fe\u00e6t leofesta, n\u00e6s ic n\u00e6fre on heore ge\u00feeahte ne heom \u00e6t\nAc ic \u00e6fre swi\u00feor ongean hio spr\u00e6c for\u00feon \u00fee ic ongeat simble his \u00feone halgan & wundorlican naman\n& he w\u00e6s on byrgene gelegd & on \u00feam \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge so\u00felice of dea\u00f0e aras & \u00e6fter his wuldorfullan\n& \u00fein bro\u00feer steffanus f\u00e6stlice on hine gelefde & \u00fea for\u00feam \u00fea fariseiscan & sundorhalgan hine to\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, min drihten, ne wit \u00feu heom \u00feas synna \u00fee hi on me wyrca\u00f0.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 min f\u00e6der eft to me, ic l\u00e6re \u00fee min liofa bearn \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu anr\u00e6dlice & f\u00e6stlice gelyfe on crist\n\u00deas \u00feinc me s\u00e6de min f\u00e6der symon swa ic eow nu ges\u00e6d h\u00e6bbe.\n\u00de\u00e6nca\u00f0 ge nu hw\u00e6\u00feer ge hit hire cy\u00fean willa\u00f0 gif hio eow \u00feises axian wille.\nHi andswarodon & cw\u00e6don, Ne geherde we n\u00e6fre \u00e6r \u00feas word ne \u00feas \u00feinc \u00fee \u00feu nu segst.\nGif \u00feeos cwen \u00feises axian wille \u00feonne warna \u00feu \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hit hire n\u00e6fre ne cy\u00f0e.\nWe hit nyten ne ne cunnen.\n\u00d0a hio \u00feus hiom betweonan spr\u00e6cen, \u00fea clipodan \u00feare cwene c\u00e6mpan \u00feider & hio hetan \u00fe\u00e6t hio\n\u00dea hio beforan hire stodan \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 hio hiom to, So\u00f0lice ic secge \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow ealle on fyre hate\nHi w\u00e6ron \u00fea sona swi\u00fee afyrhte geworden & sealdon hire \u00fea \u00e6nne \u00fee Iudas w\u00e6s gehaten & hire to\nSeo cwen forlet \u00fea hi ealle & nam Iudan \u00e6nne & him tocw\u00e6\u00f0, Nu is on \u00feinum agenum gewealde ge\nHe andswarode Iudas \u00fea hire & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gif hwylc man si hearde ofhingred & man him lecge toforan\nHim \u00fea tocw\u00e6\u00f0 seo m\u00e6ra cwen elena, gif \u00feu wille libban on heofenum o\u00f0\u00f0e on eor\u00fean \u00feonne cy\u00fe \u00feu\nIudas hire andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic nat hit ne ne can for \u00fean hit w\u00e6s gedon mare \u00feonne for\nHim andwyrde seo m\u00e6ra cwen elena, ic h\u00e6bbe ger\u00e6d on \u00feam halgum cristes bocum \u00fe\u00e6t seo stow\nAc gecy\u00fe me hw\u00e6r sio stow sy, o\u00f0\u00f0e ic mid hungre hate \u00fee acwellan.\nHire andswarode \u00fea iudas eft & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ne ic \u00fea stowe ne can ne ic \u00fea gyt geboren n\u00e6s.\n\u00dea bebead seo cwen elena \u00fe\u00e6t hine man name & sette on \u00e6nne diopne sea\u00f0 buton \u00e6te & buton w\u00e6te\n& \u00fea on \u00feam seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge \u00f0a cliopode Iudas up of \u00f0am sea\u00f0e & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eow bidde & halsige\n\u00d0a he of \u00f0am sea\u00f0e w\u00e6s \u00fea for he to \u00feare stowe \u00fee ure h\u00e6lend on ahangen w\u00e6s.\n\u00dea he \u00f0ider com \u00fea a\u00fe\u00e6nede he his handa & to criste geb\u00e6d & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0, Min drihten h\u00e6lend crist, \u00feu\n& do \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r astige upp of \u00fe\u00e6re stowe se swetesta st\u00e6nc ealra diorwur\u00fera wyrtgemanga \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00feonne\n\u00dea Iudas \u00feis godcunde gebed gefylled h\u00e6fde \u00fea sona biofode eal seo stow & \u00fe\u00e6r astah up of \u00f0\u00e6re\n\u00dea sona Iudas \u00f0\u00e6s myclum wundrode & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic so\u00felice secge \u00fe\u00e6t se anc\u00e6nneda godes sunu is\nIc \u00fee nu bidde & halsige min drihten h\u00e6lend crist \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu adilegie mine synna \u00fe\u00e6t ic mote bion on\n\u00dea Iudas \u00feas word gecweden h\u00e6fde, \u00fea genam he ane spada & dealf \u00fea eor\u00fean.\n\u00dea he h\u00e6fde gedolfen twentig fota on \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00f0an, \u00fea fand he \u00ferio roda.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s he sona swi\u00fee bli\u00fee.\nGenam \u00fea \u00f0a \u00ferio rodan & b\u00e6r hio to \u00fe\u00e6re wuldorfullan byrig ierusalem toforan \u00feare m\u00e6re cwene\nHio cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0a to Iudan, sege me on hwylc \u00feiosse roda ure h\u00e6lend ahangen w\u00e6re.\nIc wat \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea twa siondon \u00feara twegra sca\u00f0ena \u00fee on twam healfeon his hangiende w\u00e6ron.\n\u00dea nyste Iudas hire \u00fe\u00e6t to secgenne ac genam \u00fea \u00f0a \u00ferio roda & gesette heo onmiddan \u00fe\u00e6re\n\u00dea hit w\u00e6s \u00e6t none \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges \u00fea b\u00e6r man \u00e6nne geongne cniht for\u00f0feredne.\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s Iudas \u00fe\u00e6s swi\u00fee bli\u00fee & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ran cwene elenan, Hl\u00e6fdige, nu ge magon\nHw\u00e6t iudas het \u00fea settan \u00fe\u00e6t lic & genam \u00fea \u00fea ane rode & legde uppe \u00feam deadan.\nB\u00e6d \u00fea swi\u00fee giorne god \u00e6lmihtigne for his naman & for his m\u00e6ran mildheortnesse & eall \u00fe\u00e6t folc\nSe lichama l\u00e6g swa for\u00f0 dead swa he \u00e6r w\u00e6s.\nHe genam \u00fea o\u00f0re \u00fea w\u00e6s hit eal \u00fe\u00e6t ilce.\n\u00dea genam he \u00fea \u00feriddan.\n\u00dea aras se cniht sona libbende & gesund & drihtnes naman bletsode.\n& ealle \u00fea \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron bletsodon & heredon & m\u00e6rsodon drihtnes naman.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s se ni\u00fefulla diofol on helle mid eorre & mid hatheortnesse astyred & he \u00fea swi\u00fee hlude rymde\nEala \u00feu nazarenisce h\u00e6lend, \u00feurh \u00feine \u00ferowunga \u00fee \u00feu getuge to \u00fee ealle \u00fea sawla \u00fee ic \u00e6r \u00feurh me\nEala \u00feu Iudas, hw\u00e6t is \u00feis \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me nu gedon h\u00e6fst?\n\u00c6r ic \u00feurh \u00feone iudas cristes bel\u00e6wend w\u00e6s gewur\u00feod & ic mycel folces to helle geteah, nu ic \u00feurh\nIudas wear\u00f0 \u00fea gefylled mid \u00feam halgan gaste & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, se h\u00e6lend \u00fee liofa\u00f0 & rixa\u00f0 \u00fee bes\u00e6nce\nSona \u00fea n\u00e6s se diofol \u00fe\u00e6r nahw\u00e6r gesewen ne gehered.\n\u00d0a hio \u00feis geherde seo eadige cwen elena \u00fea wundrode hio swi\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s mycelan geleafan \u00fee iudas to\n& hio \u00fea halgan cristes rode bewyrcan het mid golde & mid seolfre & mid diorwur\u00feum gimmum &\n& Iudas \u00fea fulluht underfeng \u00e6t \u00feam burhbisceope & se biscop Iudas naman aw\u00e6nde & hine het\n& he \u00fea seo\u00fe\u00feen m\u00e6rlice ge\u00feeah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes for\u00f0si\u00f0e he wear\u00f0 to biscope gecoren &\n\u00d0a ongan sancta elena swi\u00f0e gironlice axian \u00fea n\u00e6glas \u00fee ures h\u00e6lendes handa & his fet \u00feurh adrifene\nHio het hiore togefeccan \u00feone halgan biscop cwiriacum \u00fee \u00e6r w\u00e6s Iudas gehaten & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic\n& he sona se halga biscop mid his m\u00e6sseprestum & mid his diaconum & mid \u00feam geleaffullum folce\n\u00dea hio to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe coman \u00fea ahof he his eagan up to heofenum & digellice on his briost beot & \u00feus\n\u00dea he \u00feas word gecweden h\u00e6fde \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 eal \u00fe\u00e6t folc, amen.\n& \u00fe\u00e6r com mycel leoht up of \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee seo halige rode on afunden w\u00e6s & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6tywedon \u00fea\nEalle \u00fea \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron spr\u00e6con & \u00feus cw\u00e6don, nu we magon oncnawan & ongeton so\u00felice \u00fe\u00e6t se\n& he \u00fea se biscop Sanctus Cwiriacus mid mycelre blisse & mid gefean genam \u00fea n\u00e6glas & hio brohte\n& heo sona heora cneowe gebygde & hire heafod ahelde to \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00fean.\n& inweardlice hio geb\u00e6d to \u00feam n\u00e6glan & giornlice \u00fe\u00e6ncan ongan hu hio ymbe \u00fea n\u00e6glas betst\n\u00d0a com st\u00e6fn of heofenum & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Nim \u00feas n\u00e6glas, elena, & heo besmi\u00feian hat on \u00feines sunu bridle\n\u00de\u00e6nne gef\u00e6r\u00f0 he sige & sibbe on \u00e6ghwylcum gefeohte.\n& heo \u00fea swa dyde swa hire beboden w\u00e6s \u00feurh \u00feone halgan gast & hio \u00fea gifede mycele \u00feinc \u00feam\n& se halga biscop swa mycele gife h\u00e6fde \u00e6t gode \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feurh his godcunda gebeda m\u00e6nige mistlice\n& heo \u00fea seo eadige cwen elena eft ongean for to rome byrig & ealle \u00feas \u00feinc \u00feam m\u00e6ran kasere\n& heo budon \u00fea eallum \u00feam folce \u00fe\u00e6t heo symble \u00feysne d\u00e6g mid mycelre arwur\u00fenesse healdan\n\u00dea iudeas naman \u00fea halgan cristes rode \u00feurh diofles lare & hio behyddon under eor\u00f0an an hund geara\n\u00dea nolde se mildheorta drihten ge\u00feafigen \u00fee on hire self willes \u00ferowode & on \u00feam rode tacne eall\nUs gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feisne d\u00e6g simble wur\u00feian mid ciricsocnum & mid \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum & mid halgum\n& motan we drihten \u00fee on \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode \u00ferowode us gefultumige \u00fe\u00e6t we hit swa to healdan moton\nSi him simble \u00feanc \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he for us \u00ferowode & si him simble lof & wuldor ealre his godnessa \u00fee he",
